---
import Legal from "../components/Legal.astro";
import { site, instagramUrl } from "../config";
---

<Legal title="Data deletion" updated="15 September 2026">
  <p>
    The only personal data this system handles is what's described in the
    <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>: the IDs needed to reply to a comment on one of my reels.
    It's deleted automatically after 14 days.
  </p>
  <p>If you want it removed sooner:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Message <a href={instagramUrl} rel="noopener">@{site.handle}</a> on Instagram and say "delete my data".</li>
    <li>Anything tied to your Instagram account is removed within 7 days, and I'll reply to confirm.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    You can also remove this app's access at any time from Instagram: Settings → Security →
    Apps and websites.
  </p>
</Legal>
